msgid "Updates the Astra theme body font family, weight, size, and other typography settings. IMPORTANT: When user specifies size like \"16px\" or \"1.5rem\", you must separate the numeric value from the unit: font_size.desktop = 16 (number), font_size.desktop-unit = \"px\" (string)."
